From b9681a8528e0dcf3471a92e05b35d0e92218e91d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:21:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - zeppelin interact module + wow protocol package

- zeppelin/wow: Reader/Writer (packed guid, cstring), SMSG_(COMPRESSED_)UPDATE_OBJECT
  parser (Object::BuildMovementUpdate incl. living/spline/stationary/rotation, values
  blocks), object Store (create/values/movement/out-of-range merge, nearest-of-entry
  queries, own quest log from PLAYER_QUEST_LOG fields); unit tests
- zeppelin/modules/interact (requires move): find, gossip_hello/select, quest_hello,
  quest_accept (waits for the quest log), quest_complete (request items -> offer reward
  -> choose reward -> quest complete), quest_log, use (GO use or a cast such as Opening
  22810, then loot_all), loot, cast (SPELL_GO / CAST_FAILED / SPELL_FAILURE), events
  (quest kill/item/complete/reward/failed/invalid, item push)
- verified live in Valley of Trials: Kaltunk 4641 accept -> Gornek turn-in (40 XP) ->
  788 accept; Galgar 4402 refused correctly before 788, accepted after; Cactus Apple
  opened with 22810 and looted (item 11583 pushed)

